    "updated_at": "2022-07-28T06:56:16Z",
    "body": "Regarding the initial proposal, seems like 101 (apart from the case of WebSocket) is advisory - the client SHOULD upgrade if it things it's advisory. So I think we can change the wording here as proposed.",
